# Galion programs named by the voice packaging contract and the desktop plan.
# Format: status<TAB>name<TAB>image<TAB>note
# status must be planned. The dry run rejects built.

planned	galion-init	desktop	PID 1 for the desktop image. Static musl. Not in this repository. The image does not boot until it exists. docs/PACKAGING.md D2. docs/voice-profile/PACKAGING.md section 3.
planned	galion-voiced	voice	Voice daemon for the voice image. Off the desktop image. Not built. docs/PACKAGING.md D2. docs/voice-profile/PACKAGING.md section 3.
planned	galion-probe	voice	Machine probe for the voice archive. Off the desktop image. Not built. docs/voice-profile/PACKAGING.md section 3.
